@startuml
title ReTool System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Client (Windows 10 64-bit)\nChrome >=81\nVue.js SPA" as Client {
  component "ReTool Web UI\n(Vue.js)" as WebUI
}

node "Local Computer\nMicroservices Host (Flask)" as LocalHost {
  component "API Gateway\n(Request Routing, Auth Enforcement)" as Gateway
  component "User Management Service\n- Registration/Login/Logout\n- Passwords, Profiles\n- System Roles & RBAC" as UserSvc
  component "Project Management Service\n- Projects CRUD\n- Members & Roles\n- Baselines" as ProjSvc
  component "Requirements Management Service\n- Items CRUD & Tree\n- Move Positions\n- Import (Word)\n- Forward Tracing" as ReqSvc
  component "Log Collector\n(Persistent Logs)" as LogCollector
}

node "Algorithm Server\nAmazon Linux 2 (EC2 t2.xlarge)" as AlgoServer {
  component "Algorithm Service\n(NLP, PyTorch, Word2vec)\n- Itemization\n- Structuring\n- Common Identification\n- Conflict Detection\n- Association Analysis" as AlgoSvc
  component "File Storage\n(Uploads: Word Documents)" as FileStore
}

database "MongoDB\nCRUD Operations" as MongoDB

node "Offsite Disaster Recovery" as DR {
  component "Backup Copies (3x)\nPeriodic Backup" as Backup
}

WebUI -[#blue]-> Gateway : Secure Web APIs (Network)
Gateway -[#blue]-> UserSvc : route /user
Gateway -[#blue]-> ProjSvc : route /project
Gateway -[#blue]-> ReqSvc : route /requirements

ReqSvc -[#blue]-> AlgoSvc : Analysis Requests\n(Itemization, Structuring, Common, Conflict, Association)
ReqSvc -[#gray]-> FileStore : Store Uploads (Word Docs)
AlgoSvc -[#blue]-> ReqSvc : Analysis Results

UserSvc -[#brown]-> MongoDB : Users, Roles, Permissions
ProjSvc -[#brown]-> MongoDB : Projects, Members, Roles, Baselines
ReqSvc -[#brown]-> MongoDB : Requirements, Tree, Forward Tracing, Analysis Results
LogCollector -[#brown]-> MongoDB : Logs

MongoDB -[#darkgreen]-> Backup : Periodic Backup (Offsite DR)

note top of WebUI
- Authentication UI (register, login, logout)
- User management (admins)
- Project list, info, members, baselines
- Requirements management (tree, create, import, modify, delete, move)
- Requirement analysis (structuring, common, conflict, association)
- Forward tracing (code, tests, personnel)
end note

note right of Gateway
Microservice architecture (Flask)
- Auth enforcement (NFR-010)
- Rate limiting / peak control (C-005)
- Secure network interfaces (NFR-015)
end note

note right of AlgoSvc
Runs on high-performance server (C-007, AD-003)
Uses NLP, PyTorch, Word2vec
end note

note bottom of MongoDB
- Periodic backup & offsite DR (NFR-009)
- Privacy & personalized info protection (NFR-011, DR-016)
- Injection protection via validation (NFR-013)
end note

note bottom of LocalHost
Gateway, user/project/requirements services deployed locally (C-006)
end note

note bottom of Client
Front-end/back-end separation (C-002)
Client hardware/software constraints (C-009..C-011)
end note

@enduml
